Source: mt7668
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: retro98boy <retro98boy@qq.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), dh-dkms | dkms
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mt7668-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, make, gcc, perl
Description: MediaTek MT7668 SDIO WiFi and Bluetooth drivers (DKMS)
 This package contains sources for the wlan_mt76x8_sdio and bt_mt7668
 modules. DKMS builds the modules for installed kernels with matching
 headers, supporting Linux 5.15 through 7.3.
 .
 Firmware is available in mt7668-firmware. Board-specific device-tree
 configuration is not included.

Package: mt7668-firmware
Section: non-free/kernel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MediaTek MT7668 SDIO WiFi and Bluetooth firmware
 This package contains firmware and default configuration files for the
 wlan_mt76x8_sdio and bt_mt7668 drivers, imported from CoreELEC/MT7668.
